{{smaller block|⟦300⟧ The following formula of dark ultramarine blue will serve as a type of all other pigment printing colours:—}}

{{smaller block|<poem>24 ℔ artificial ultramarine.</poem>}}

{{smaller block|⟦300⟧ Place in grinding machine and beat up gradually with
<poem>4½ gallons 40 per cent. blood albumen solution.
2½ ,, tragacanth mucilage, 8 oz. per gallon.
