{450 ,, alkaline dextrine paste.
{150 ,, indigo 20 per cent. paste (ground up in gum).
{200 ,, alkaline dextrine paste.
Thickening {150 parts dextrine or British gum.
{850 ,, caustic soda, 70° Tw.</poem>}}

{{smaller block|⟦3100⟧ Print, dry, “age” and wash off in a copious supply of cold water}}
